{"RukuNumber":274,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":20,"SurahIndex":"020","VerseNumber":90,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَقَدۡ قَالَ لَهُمۡ هَٰرُونُ مِن قَبۡلُ يَٰقَوۡمِ إِنَّمَا فُتِنتُم بِهِۦۖ وَإِنَّ رَبَّكُمُ ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنُ فَٱتَّبِعُونِي وَأَطِيعُوٓاْ أَمۡرِي","TajweedText":"وَلَقَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed> قَالَ لَهُمْ هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>رُونُ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ق</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لُ يَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>قَوْمِ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َمَا فُتِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed>‌ۖ وَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ رَبَّكُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رَّحْمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نُ فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّبِعُونِى وَأَطِيع<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> أَمْرِى <span class=end>٩٠</span>","End":"٩٠","PageNumber":318,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":274,"MaqraNumber":127,"HizbNumber":32,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":20,"SurahIndex":"020","VerseNumber":91,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ لَن نَّبۡرَحَ عَلَيۡهِ عَٰكِفِينَ حَتَّىٰ يَرۡجِعَ إِلَيۡنَا مُوسَىٰ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> ل<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ن</tajweed>َّ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>رَحَ عَلَيْهِ عَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كِفِينَ حَتَّىٰ يَرْجِعَ إِلَيْنَا مُوسَىٰ <span class=end>٩١</span>","End":"٩١","PageNumber":318,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":274,"MaqraNumber":127,"HizbNumber":32,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":20,"SurahIndex":"020","VerseNumber":92,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ يَٰهَٰرُونُ مَا مَنَعَكَ إِذۡ رَأَيۡتَهُمۡ ضَلُّوٓاْ","TajweedText":"قَالَ يَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>رُونُ مَا مَنَعَكَ إِذْ رَأَيْتَهُمْ ضَلُّوٓ<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <span class=end>٩٢</span>","End":"٩٢","PageNumber":318,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":274,"MaqraNumber":127,"HizbNumber":32,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":20,"SurahIndex":"020","VerseNumber":93,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَلَّا تَتَّبِعَنِۖ أَفَعَصَيۡتَ أَمۡرِي","TajweedText":"أَلَّا تَتَّبِعَنِ‌ۖ أَفَعَصَيْتَ أَمْرِى <span class=end>٩٣</span>","End":"٩٣","PageNumber":318,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":274,"MaqraNumber":127,"HizbNumber":32,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":20,"SurahIndex":"020","VerseNumber":94,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ يَبۡنَؤُمَّ لَا تَأۡخُذۡ بِلِحۡيَتِي وَلَا بِرَأۡسِيٓۖ إِنِّي خَشِيتُ أَن تَقُولَ فَرَّقۡتَ بَيۡنَ بَنِيٓ إِسۡرَـٰٓءِيلَ وَلَمۡ تَرۡقُبۡ قَوۡلِي","TajweedText":"قَالَ يَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>نَؤُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ لَا تَأْخُذْ بِلِحْيَتِى وَلَا بِرَأْس<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ‌ۖ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>ِى خَشِيتُ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ت</tajweed>َقُولَ فَرَّ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>تَ بَيْنَ بَن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> إِسْر<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َٲ</tajweed>ٓءِيلَ وَلَمْ تَرْقُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed> قَوْلِى <span class=end>٩٤</span>","End":"٩٤","PageNumber":318,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":274,"MaqraNumber":127,"HizbNumber":32,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":20,"SurahIndex":"020","VerseNumber":95,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ فَمَا خَطۡبُكَ يَٰسَٰمِرِيُّ","TajweedText":"قَالَ فَمَا خَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>طْ</tajweed>بُكَ يَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>سَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>مِرِىُّ <span class=end>٩٥</span>","End":"٩٥","PageNumber":318,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":274,"MaqraNumber":127,"HizbNumber":32,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":20,"SurahIndex":"020","VerseNumber":96,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ بَصُرۡتُ بِمَا لَمۡ يَبۡصُرُواْ بِهِۦ فَقَبَضۡتُ قَبۡضَةٗ مِّنۡ أَثَرِ ٱلرَّسُولِ فَنَبَذۡتُهَا وَكَذَٰلِكَ سَوَّلَتۡ لِي نَفۡسِي","TajweedText":"قَالَ بَصُرْتُ بِمَا لَمْ يَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>صُرُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> فَقَبَضْتُ قَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>ضَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً م</tajweed>ِّنْ أَثَرِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رَّسُولِ فَنَبَذْتُهَا وَكَذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكَ سَوَّلَتْ لِى نَفْسِى <span class=end>٩٦</span>","End":"٩٦","PageNumber":318,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":274,"MaqraNumber":127,"HizbNumber":32,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":20,"SurahIndex":"020","VerseNumber":97,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ فَٱذۡهَبۡ فَإِنَّ لَكَ فِي ٱلۡحَيَوٰةِ أَن تَقُولَ لَا مِسَاسَۖ وَإِنَّ لَكَ مَوۡعِدٗا لَّن تُخۡلَفَهُۥۖ وَٱنظُرۡ إِلَىٰٓ إِلَٰهِكَ ٱلَّذِي ظَلۡتَ عَلَيۡهِ عَاكِفٗاۖ لَّنُحَرِّقَنَّهُۥ ثُمَّ لَنَنسِفَنَّهُۥ فِي ٱلۡيَمِّ نَسۡفًا","TajweedText":"قَالَ فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>ذْهَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed> فَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ لَكَ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَيَ<tajweed class=slnt>و</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>ٲ</tajweed>ةِ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ت</tajweed>َقُولَ لَا مِسَاسَ‌ۖ وَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ لَكَ مَوْعِ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>دًا ل</tajweed>َّ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ت</tajweed>ُخْلَفَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed>‌ۖ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>نظ</tajweed>ُرْ إِلَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ىٰٓ</tajweed> إِلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هِكَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِى ظَ