false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يَتَخَٰفَتُونَ بَيۡنَهُمۡ إِن لَّبِثۡتُمۡ إِلَّا عَشۡرٗا","TajweedText":"يَتَخَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>فَتُونَ بَيْنَهُمْ إ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ِن ل</tajweed>َّبِثْتُمْ إِلَّا عَشْرًا <span class=end>١٠٣</span>","End":"١٠٣","PageNumber":319,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":274,"MaqraNumber":127,"HizbNumber":32,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":20,"SurahIndex":"020","VerseNumber":104,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"نَّحۡنُ أَعۡلَمُ بِمَا يَقُولُونَ إِذۡ يَقُولُ أَمۡثَلُهُمۡ طَرِيقَةً إِن لَّبِثۡتُمۡ إِلَّا يَوۡمٗا","TajweedText":"نَّحْنُ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا يَقُولُونَ إِذْ يَقُولُ أَمْثَلُهُمْ طَرِيقَةً إ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ِن ل</tajweed>َّبِثْتُمْ إِلَّا يَوْمًا <span class=end>١٠٤</span>","End":"١٠٤","PageNumber":319,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":274,"MaqraNumber":127,"HizbNumber":32,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false}]}